{
  "presses": ["L-pinky-top", "L-index-home", "R-pinky-top", "R-index-top-in"],
  "note": "T1 S1={H,K,P,Z} on keys {Lpt,Lih,Rih-in,Rpt}; rot(after T1)={R-index-bottom,R-index-home-in(=Rih-in),R-middle-home}. T2 press {Lpt,Lih,Rpt}+E=R-index-top-in (non-rot-in-set) to ensure S2 has 3-of-S1 +1 new; then letter missing from S2∩S1 => letter-at-Rih-in at T1."
}

{
  "presses": ["R-index-top-in", "L-pinky-bottom", "R-index-top", "L-index-top-in"],
  "note": "T5: {R-index-top-in, L-pinky-bottom, L-middle-bottom, R-index-top} => {A,B,K,N} (letters unchanged since rotated keys were different). Rotation after T5: {L-index-top-in,L-middle-top,R-index-home} permuted, no fixed points. T6 plan press {R-index-top-in,L-pinky-bottom,R-index-top,L-index-top-in} to exclude L-middle-bottom; compare set vs {A,B,K,N} to locate which of A,B,K,N is on L-middle-bottom."
}

{
  "presses": [
    "R-index-top-in",
    "L-pinky-bottom",
    "L-middle-bottom",
    "L-index-top-in"
  ],
  "locks": {
    "L-middle-bottom": "B",
    "L-index-top-in": "E"
  },
  "note": "Known: L-middle-bottom=B; L-index-top-in=E. From T5/T6: {R-index-top-in,L-pinky-bottom,R-index-top}={A,K,N}. T7 press {R-index-top-in,L-pinky-bottom,L-middle-bottom,L-index-top-in} (locks B,E). T8 press {R-index-top,L-pinky-bottom,L-middle-bottom,L-index-top-in}; then L-pinky-bottom = intersection(S7,S8) minus {B,E}."
}

{
  "presses": ["R-index-top", "R-index-top-in", "L-middle-bottom", "L-index-top-in"],
  "note": "After last press (R-index-top-in,L-pinky-bottom,L-middle-bottom,L-index-top-in) symbols={A,B,E,K}; locked: L-middle-bottom=B, L-index-top-in=E. Hence during that press {R-index-top-in,L-pinky-bottom}={A,K}. Rotation after that turn: L-pinky-bottom and R-index-home rotated => L-pinky-bottom letter changed before next turn. Next: press {R-index-top,R-index-top-in,L-middle-bottom,L-index-top-in} to read current letters on R-index-top and R-index-top-in."
}

{
  "presses": ["R-index-top-in", "R-index-home-in", "R-index-top", "L-index-top-in"],
  "locks": { "R-index-top": "N", "L-index-top-in": "E" },
  "note": "t15 deduced (no rot): R-index-home-in=F (from t14); L-index-top-in=E (t14 set {A,E,S}); R-index-top=N (since t15 set {A,F,N,S}); so R-index-top-in and R-ring-top are {A,S} in some order. Now press {R-index-top-in,R-index-home-in,R-index-top,L-index-top-in} => {?,F,N,E}; last symbol reveals R-index-top-in=A/S; then R-ring-top=other."
}

{
  "presses": ["R-index-top-in", "R-index-home-in", "L-index-top-in", "R-middle-top"],
  "locks": {
    "R-index-top-in": "A",
    "R-index-home-in": "F",
    "L-index-top-in": "E",
    "R-index-top": "N",
    "R-ring-top": "S"
  },
  "note": "t16 locks: R-index-top-in=A; R-index-home-in=F; R-index-top=N; L-index-top-in=E; R-ring-top=S (since {A,S}). Next press: {R-index-top-in,R-index-home-in,L-index-top-in,R-middle-top} => {A,E,F,?} to resolve R-middle-top (check rotation notice)."
}

{
  "presses": ["R-index-top-in", "R-index-home-in", "R-ring-top", "L-index-home-in"],
  "locks": {"R-middle-top": "T"},
  "note": "Known@end16 (no rotations): R-index-top-in=A; R-index-home-in=F; L-index-top-in=E; R-index-top=N; R-ring-top=S; R-middle-top=T. Plan t17 press {R-index-top-in,R-index-home-in,R-ring-top,L-index-home-in} => {A,F,S,?} so L-index-home-in=?."
}

{
  "presses": [
    "L-index-bottom-in",
    "R-index-bottom",
    "L-pinky-home",
    "L-middle-bottom"
  ],
  "note": "Known(no rot t18): R-index-top-in=A; R-index-home-in=F; L-index-top-in=E; R-index-top=N; R-ring-top=S; R-middle-top=T; L-index-home-in=X. t18: {R-index-bottom-in,R-index-home,R-middle-home,L-ring-home}={J,K,M,Q} (perm). Press/plan t19: {L-index-bottom-in,R-index-bottom,L-pinky-home,L-middle-bottom}."
}
